## Instructions

Focus ONLY on completing the subtask assigned above. Do NOT attempt to solve the entire SWE task — other subtasks will handle the remaining work.

Use the available tools to complete your subtask step by step. When done, call the `finish` tool with:
- `useful_trajectory_indexes`: The indexes of the steps that contain essential information the next sub-agent MUST see. Be selective — only include steps that contain:
  1. The step that revealed the bug location (file path, function name, line number)
  2. The step that showed the current code at the bug location
  3. The step that made the actual code change(s)
  4. The step with test/verification results
  5. Steps that revealed related code that must also be changed

Your step indexes start from 0. Step 0 is your first tool call, step 1 is your second, etc.
